# Inbox PII protection - defense in depth layer 1 (.gitignore)
# Layer 2: README.md per subfolder (cognitive barrier)
# Layer 3: pre-commit hook (only layer that blocks git add -f)
#
# Deny-by-default: only explicitly public artifacts may be versioned from this
# tree. Personal and working zones are protected WITHOUT being named here —
# anything not allowlisted below stays local by construction.

/*/
!/first-party/
!/templates/

/*.md
!README.md
!context.md

# Regulated reference zones: tracked placeholders only
/Contratos/*
!/Contratos/.gitkeep
!/Contratos/README.md
/Firmas/*
!/Firmas/.gitkeep
!/Firmas/README.md
/Muestras/*
!/Muestras/.gitkeep
!/Muestras/README.md
